#: woof/templates/woof/privacy_policy.html:246
msgid "We follow generally accepted international data protection principles."
msgstr ""
"Pridržavamo se opšteprihvaćenih međunarodnih principa zaštite podataka."

#: woof/templates/woof/privacy_policy.html:252
msgid ""
"The Website uses cookies to ensure proper operation and analyze traffic. "
"Manage cookies in your browser settings."
msgstr ""
"Veb-sajt koristi kolačiće da bi obezbedio ispravan rad i analizu saobraćaja. "
"Kolačićima upravljajte kroz podešavanja pregledača."

#: woof/templates/woof/privacy_policy.html:256
msgid "More details in our"
msgstr "Više detalja u našoj"

#: woof/templates/woof/privacy_policy.html:263
msgid ""
"When you make a choice in the cookie notice (accept, decline, or close it), "
"we record a small evidence entry in our consent register: a randomly "
"generated consent ID, your choice, the notice version, and the timestamp "
"(Article 7 GDPR). This entry contains no name, email, IP address, or other "
"identifying information."
msgstr ""
"Kada napravite izbor u obaveštenju o kolačićima (prihvatite, odbijete ili "
"zatvorite), beležimo mali dokazni unos u registar saglasnosti: nasumično "
"generisan ID saglasnosti, vaš izbor, verziju obaveštenja i vremensku oznaku "
"(član 7 GDPR). Ovaj unos ne sadrži ime, e-adresu, IP adresu niti druge "
"identifikacione podatke."

#: woof/templates/woof/privacy_policy.html:270
msgid ""
"We do not sell or rent personal data. Information may be shared with "
"analytics providers or as required by law."
msgstr ""
"Ne prodajemo niti iznajmljujemo lične podatke. Informacije se mogu deliti sa "
"pružaocima analitike ili kada to zahteva zakon."

#: woof/templates/woof/privacy_policy.html:277
msgid ""
"Data may be processed outside your country. Appropriate safeguards are "
"applied when needed."
msgstr ""
"Podaci se mogu obrađivati van vaše zemlje. Kada je potrebno, primenjuju se "
"odgovarajuće zaštitne mere."

#: woof/templates/woof/privacy_policy.html:280
msgid ""
"Where data is transferred to Google LLC (based in the United States) for "
"analytics, the transfer is covered by Google's Standard Contractual Clauses "
"and its Data Processing Addendum."
msgstr ""
"Kada se podaci prenose kompaniji Google LLC (sa sedištem u SAD) u svrhe "
"analitike, prenos pokrivaju Google Standardne ugovorne klauzule i Dodatak o "
"obradi podataka."

#: woof/templates/woof/privacy_policy.html:286
msgid ""
"Data is retained only as long as necessary for the purposes described in "
"this policy."
msgstr ""
"Podaci se čuvaju samo onoliko dugo koliko je neophodno za svrhe opisane u "
"ovoj politici."

#: woof/templates/woof/privacy_policy.html:293
msgid ""
"Depending on your location, you may have the right to access, correct, "
"delete, or restrict your data."
msgstr ""
"U zavisnosti od vaše lokacije, možete imati pravo na pristup, ispravku, "
"brisanje ili ograničenje obrade vaših podataka."

#: woof/templates/woof/privacy_policy.html:296
msgid ""
"If you are in the EEA or the UK, you may also withdraw your consent at any "
"time and lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority (in "
"Italy, the Garante)."
msgstr ""
"Ako ste u EEA ili UK, saglasnost takođe možete povući u bilo kom trenutku i "
"podneti žalbu lokalnom organu za zaštitu podataka."

#: woof/templates/woof/privacy_policy.html:299
msgid "Requests:"
msgstr "Zahtevi:"

#: woof/templates/woof/privacy_policy.html:301
#: woof/templates/woof/terms_and_conditions.html:203
msgid "Contact form"
msgstr "Kontakt forma"

#: woof/templates/woof/privacy_policy.html:308
msgid ""
"The Website is not intended for children under 18. We do not knowingly "
"collect data from minors."
msgstr ""
"Veb-sajt nije namenjen deci mlađoj od 18 godina. Namerno ne prikupljamo "
"podatke od maloletnika."

#: woof/templates/woof/privacy_policy.html:315
msgid ""
"This Privacy Policy may be updated periodically. Updated versions will be "
"posted on this page."
msgstr ""
"Ova Politika privatnosti može se povremeno ažurirati. Ažurirane verzije biće "
"objavljene na ovoj stranici."

#: woof/templates/woof/privacy_policy.html:323
msgid "Questions? Contact:"
msgstr "Pitanja? Kontakt:"

#: woof/templates/woof/privacy_policy.html:324
msgid "woofdogs23@gmail.com"
msgstr "woofdogs23@gmail.com"

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:50
msgid "What to expect during puppyhood"
msgstr "Šta očekivati tokom perioda šteneta"

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:52
msgid ""
"Puppyhood is the earliest and most formative stage of a dog’s life. During "
"this period, dogs rapidly develop habits, reactions, confidence, and social "
"understanding of the world around them."
msgstr ""
"Period šteneta je najranija i najformativnija faza života psa. Tokom tog "
"perioda psi brzo razvijaju navike, reakcije, samopouzdanje i društveno "
"razumevanje sveta oko sebe."

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:56
msgid ""
"Raising a puppy is not only about care, but about helping the dog adapt "
"safely and gradually to human environments, routines, sounds, and "
"interactions."
msgstr ""
"Odgajanje šteneta nije samo briga o njemu, već pomaganje psu da se bezbedno "
"i postepeno prilagodi ljudskom okruženju, rutinama, zvucima i interakcijama."

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:60
msgid "The first days at home"
msgstr "Prvi dani kod kuće"

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:62
msgid ""
"Moving into a new home can be stressful for a puppy. New smells, unfamiliar "
"people, and separation from littermates create a major environmental change."
msgstr ""
"Preseljenje u novi dom može biti stresno za štene. Novi mirisi, nepoznati "
"ljudi i odvajanje od legla stvaraju veliku promenu okruženja."

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:66
msgid ""
"The first days should remain calm and predictable. A quiet resting space and "
"stable routine help the puppy adapt more comfortably."
msgstr ""
"Prvi dani treba da ostanu mirni i predvidljivi. Tih prostor za odmor i "
"stabilna rutina pomažu štenetu da se udobnije prilagodi."

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:69
msgid "A sample first-week schedule"
msgstr "Primer rasporeda prve nedelje"

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:71
msgid ""
"The first week is for adaptation, not education. A simple rhythm works well: "
"wake up and go outside immediately, short play, breakfast, a long calm rest, "
"a short walk, rest again, an evening walk, dinner, and quiet time before bed."
msgstr ""
"Prva nedelja je za navikavanje, a ne za vaspitanje. Jednostavan ritam dobro "
"funkcioniše: buđenje i odmah napolje, kratka igra, doručak, dug miran odmor, "
"kratka šetnja, ponovo odmor, večernja šetnja, večera i tiho vreme pre "
"spavanja."

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:73
msgid ""
"Keep visitors, trips and noise to a minimum during this week. The puppy only "
"needs to learn two things: where its place is, and that the household is "
"predictable."
msgstr ""
"Tokom ove nedelje svedite posete, izlaske i buku na minimum. Štencu treba da "
"nauči samo dve stvari: gde je njegovo mesto i da je domaćinstvo predvidivo."

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:76
msgid "House training: a practical routine"
msgstr "Navikavanje na kuću: praktična rutina"

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:78
msgid ""
"Take the puppy outside right after waking up, after every meal, after play, "
"and before sleep. Puppies of eight to ten weeks usually need to go every two "
"to three hours; older puppies can wait longer."
msgstr ""
"Izvedite štene odmah posle buđenja, posle svakog obroka, posle igre i pre "
"spavanja. Štenci od osam do deset nedelja obično moraju napolje na svaka dva-"
"tri sata; starija štenci mogu da duže čekaju."

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:80
msgid ""
"Choose one spot and use the same phrase each time. Praise or treat the puppy "
"immediately after it finishes — the reward must come within a second or two "
"to stay connected with the action."
msgstr ""
"Izaberite jedno mesto i svaki put koristite istu frazu. Pohvalite ili "
"nagradite štene odmah nakon što završi — nagrada mora stići u roku od jedne-"
"dve sekunde da bi ostala povezana sa radnjom."

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:82
msgid ""
"Accidents are part of the process. Clean the spot with an enzyme cleaner so "
"the smell does not invite a repeat; punishment after the fact only teaches "
"the puppy to hide from you while eliminating."
msgstr ""
"Nezgode su deo procesa. Očistite mesto enzimskim sredstvom da miris ne "
"pozove na ponavljanje; kazna nakon činjenice uči štene samo da se skriva od "
"vas dok vrši nuždu."

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:85
msgid "Early socialization"
msgstr "Rana socijalizacija"

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:87
msgid ""
"Early socialization introduces the puppy to different environments, sounds, "
"surfaces, people, and situations. Positive early experiences help build "
"confidence and adaptability later in life."
msgstr ""
"Rana socijalizacija upoznaje štene sa različitim okruženjima, zvucima, "
"površinama, ljudima i situacijama. Pozitivna rana iskustva pomažu izgradnji "
"samopouzdanja i prilagodljivosti kasnije u životu."

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:91
msgid ""
"Socialization should happen gradually and without overwhelming the puppy. "
"Too much stimulation at once can create stress instead of confidence."
msgstr ""
"Socijalizacija treba da se odvija postepeno i bez preopterećenja šteneta. "
"Previše stimulacije odjednom može stvoriti stres umesto samopouzdanja."

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:94
msgid "A socialization checklist"
msgstr "Kontrolna lista socijalizacije"

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:96
msgid ""
"Make a short list and work through it slowly: different surfaces (grass, "
"pavement, metal grates, laminate flooring), common sounds (vacuum cleaner, "
"traffic, doorbell, fireworks recordings at low volume), and calm people of "
"different ages and appearances."
msgstr ""
"Napravite kratak spisak i polako ga obrađujte: različite podloge (trava, "
"trotoar, metalne rešetke, laminat), uobičajeni zvuci (usisivač, saobraćaj, "
"zvono, snimci vatrometa na niskoj jačini) i mirni ljudi različitog uzrasta i "
"izgleda."

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:98
msgid ""
"Pair each new experience with something the puppy likes — food, play, or "
"attention — and end the session before the puppy becomes overwhelmed. Three "
"short positive encounters teach more than one long overwhelming one."
msgstr ""
"Svako novo iskustvo povežite sa nečim što štene voli — hranom, igrom ili "
"pažnjom — i završite sesiju pre nego što se štene preoptereti. Tri kratka "
"pozitivna susreta uče više od jednog dugog koji preplavljuje."

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:100
msgid "How much walking is right"
msgstr "Koliko je šetnje pravo"

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:102
msgid ""
"A common rule of thumb for growing puppies: about five minutes of structured "
"walking per month of age, twice a day. A three-month-old therefore gets "
"roughly fifteen minutes per walk, plus free play at home."
msgstr ""
"Uobičajeno pravilo za rastuće štence: oko pet minuta strukturisane šetnje po "
"mesecu uzrasta, dvaput dnevno. Štene od tri meseca dobija dakle otprilike "
"petnaest minuta po šetnji, plus slobodnu igru kod kuće."

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:104
msgid ""
"Surfaces, sounds and slow exploration matter more than distance. Avoid "
"forced long marches, excessive stairs, and running beside a bicycle while "
"the joints are still forming."
msgstr ""
"Podloge, zvuci i sporo istraživanje važniji su od udaljenosti. Izbegavajte "
"nametnute duge marševe, preterano penjanje stepenicama i trčanje pored "
"bicikla dok se zglobovi još oblikuju."

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:107
msgid "Sleep and daily rhythm"
msgstr "San i dnevni ritam"

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:109
msgid ""
"Puppies sleep significantly more than adult dogs and require frequent rest "
"periods. Overtired puppies often become more restless, reactive, or "
"difficult to calm."
msgstr ""
"Štenci spavaju znatno više od odraslih pasa i zahtevaju česte periode "
"odmora. Preumorna štenad često postaju nemirnija, reaktivnija ili ih je teže "
"smiriti."

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:112
msgid ""
"A stable daily rhythm helps regulate energy and improves adaptation to home "
"life."
msgstr ""
"Stabilan dnevni ritam pomaže regulaciji energije i poboljšava prilagođavanje "
"kućnom životu."

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:114
msgid "Where the puppy sleeps"
msgstr "Gde štene spava"

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:116
msgid ""
"Choose one quiet corner — not a corridor and not a draughty spot. A bed or a "
"crate of the right size: the puppy should be able to lie fully stretched out "
"and turn around comfortably."
msgstr ""
"Izaberite jedan miran ugao — ne hodnik i ne promajno mesto. Ležaj ili boks "
"odgovarajuće veličine: štene treba da može potpuno da se isprži i udobno se "
"okrene."

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:118
msgid ""
"The first nights are often noisy. A warm hot-water bottle and a soft ticking "
"clock can mimic the littermates; decide in advance whether the puppy may "
"sleep in your bed, and keep that rule consistent from day one."
msgstr ""
"Prve noći često su bučne. Topla boca s vodom i mek tiktajući sat mogu da "
"oponašaju braću iz legla; unapred odlučite da li štene sme da spava u vašem "
"krevetu i držite to pravilo dosledno od prvog dana."

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:121
msgid "Teething and chewing phase"
msgstr "Faza nicanja zuba i žvakanja"

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:123
msgid ""
"During teething, puppies naturally explore objects through chewing. This "
"stage is temporary but requires patience and proper management of the "
"environment."
msgstr ""
"Tokom nicanja zuba štenad prirodno istražuje predmete žvakanjem. Ova faza je "
"privremena, ali zahteva strpljenje i pravilno upravljanje okruženjem."

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:126
msgid ""
"Safe chew toys and supervision help redirect destructive chewing behavior."
msgstr ""
"Bezbedne igračke za žvakanje i nadzor pomažu da se destruktivno žvakanje "
"usmeri na pravu stvar."

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:128
msgid "Biting and bite inhibition"
msgstr "Ugriz i inhibicija ugriza"

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:130
msgid ""
"Puppies explore and play with their mouths, so biting is normal. Teach bite "
"inhibition by stopping the game the exact moment teeth touch skin: stand up, "
"turn away, wait a few seconds, then resume play."
msgstr ""
"Štenci istražuju i igraju se ustima, pa je ugriz normalan. Učite inhibiciju "
"ugriza tako što ćete zaustaviti igru u tačnom momentu kada zubi dotaknu "
"kožu: ustanite, odvrnite se, sačekajte nekoliko sekundi, pa nastavite igru."

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:132
msgid ""
"Never use your hand as a toy. If the puppy bites too hard, yelp once, go "
"quiet and pause the game; over a few weeks the bite pressure softens "
"naturally."
msgstr ""
"Nikad ne koristite ruku kao igračku. Ako štene ugrize previše jako, jeknite "
"jednom, utihnite i napravite pauzu u igri; tokom nekoliko nedelja pritisak "
"ugriza se prirodno omekša."

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:135
msgid "Building confidence"
msgstr "Izgradnja samopouzdanja"

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:137
msgid ""
"Confidence develops through repeated positive experiences and predictable "
"routines. Gentle exposure to new environments helps puppies learn that "
"unfamiliar situations are safe."
msgstr ""
"Samopouzdanje se razvija kroz ponovljena pozitivna iskustva i predvidljive "
"rutine. Nežno izlaganje novim okruženjima pomaže štenetu da nauči da su "
"nepoznate situacije bezbedne."

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:140
msgid ""
"Fearful reactions during puppyhood are normal and should be handled calmly "
"rather than punished."
msgstr ""
"Strahovite reakcije tokom perioda šteneta su normalne i treba ih rešavati "
"smireno, a ne kažnjavanjem."

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:143
msgid "Teaching to be alone"
msgstr "Učenje da bude sam"

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:145
msgid ""
"Being alone is learned, not innate. Start with tiny departures: stand up, "
"step out for three seconds, come back — and stay boring. Repeat until the "
"puppy stays completely calm."
msgstr ""
"Biti sam se uči, ne rađa se. Počnite s mikroskopskim odlascima: ustanite, "
"izađite na tri sekunde, vratite se — i budite dosadni. Ponavljajte dok štene "
"ne ostane potpuno mirno."

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:147
msgid ""
"Then increase the time gradually: a few seconds, then a minute, then several "
"minutes. Leave a predictable cue — a long-lasting chew or a stuffed toy — "
"and never make arrivals or departures emotional events."
msgstr ""
"Zatim postepeno povećavajte vreme: nekoliko sekundi, pa minut, pa nekoliko "
"minuta. Ostavite predvidiv znak — dugačku glodalicu ili punjenu igračku — i "
"nikad ne pretvarajte dolaske ili odlaske u emocionalne događaje."

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:150
msgid "Puppy-proofing your home"
msgstr "Kuća bezbedna za štene"

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:152
msgid ""
"Get down to the puppy's eye level and remove what it can reach: cables, "
"small objects, shoes, cleaning products, toxic plants and dangling curtains. "
"Closed doors beat constant supervision."
msgstr ""
"Spuštite se na nivo štenetovih očiju i uklonite ono do čega može da dođe: "
"kablove, sitne predmete, obuću, sredstva za čišćenje, toksične biljke i "
"viseće zavese. Zatvorena vrata pobeđuju stalni nadzor."

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:154
msgid ""
"Secure the trash bin, keep bathroom doors closed, and use baby gates to "
"limit the first weeks to one or two rooms. The smaller the free space, the "
"fewer mistakes everyone has to correct."
msgstr ""
"Osigurajte kantu za smeće, držite vrata od kupatila zatvorena i koristite "
"dečija ograda da prve nedelje ograničite na jednu-dve sobe. Što je slobodan "
"prostor manji, manje grešaka svi moraju da ispravljaju."

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:157
msgid "First veterinary visits"
msgstr "Prve posete veterinaru"

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:159
msgid ""
"Book a check-up in the first days after moving in. The vet will examine the "
"puppy, discuss the timing of vaccinations and deworming, and answer feeding "
"questions — take a written list of those questions with you."
msgstr ""
"Zakažite pregled u prvim danima posle useljenja. Veterinar će pregledati "
"štene, razgovarati o vremenu vakcinacija i odcrvljivanja i odgovoriti na "
"pitanja o ishrani — ponesite pisani spisak tih pitanja sa sobom."

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:161
msgid ""
"Ask for a pet passport or health record, note the microchip number, and keep "
"all documents in one place: you will need them for travel, grooming, "
"insurance, and later for any specialist consultation."
msgstr ""
"Zatražite pasoš za kućne ljubimce ili zdravstveni dosije, zapišite broj "
"mikročipa i držite sve dokumente na jednom mestu: trebaće vam za putovanja, "
"negu, osiguranje i kasnije za bilo kakvu specijalističku konsultaciju."

#: woof/templates/woof/puppy.html:166
msgid ""
"Puppyhood is a short but extremely important developmental stage. Stable "
"routines, gradual socialization, patience, and a safe environment help "
"create a more confident and adaptable adult dog."
msgstr ""
"Period šteneta je kratka, ali izuzetno važna razvojna faza. Stabilne rutine, "
"postepena socijalizacija, strpljenje i bezbedno okruženje pomažu stvaranju "
"samouverenijeg i prilagodljivijeg odraslog psa."

